    "note": "<p>What I post is my mind playing tricks on me. What I build in <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/DevOps\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DevOps</span></a> is me playing tricks on systems.</p><p>I repost and comment — I don’t just like and follow. Autistic <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/sysadmin\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>sysadmin</span></a>, obviously.</p>",
