   "replies_count": 0,
   "reblogs_count": 4,
   "favourites_count": 0,
   "quotes_count": 0,
   "edited_at": null,
   "content": "<p>🤖 NEW: Engineers in <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/Singapore\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>Singapore</span></a> built <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/ALBATROSS\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>ALBATROSS</span></a>, a roughly 1 kg <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/robot\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>robot</span></a> that falls from a <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/drone\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>drone</span></a> at about 150 m, spins its limbs to slow the descent from around 110 to 24 km/h, then converts into a <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/sailboat\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>sailboat</span></a> with a <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/fish\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>fish</span></a>-like rudder. Three actuators and three sensors let it navigate Singapore reservoirs autonomously for hours.</p><p>👉 <a href=\"https://www.popsci.com/technology/new-robot-fly-sail-swim/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">popsci.com/technology/new-robo</span><span class=\"invisible\">t-fly-sail-swim/</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/biomimicry\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>biomimicry</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/engineering\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>engineering</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/oceans\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>oceans</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/sailing\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>sailing</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/swan\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>swan</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/robotics\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>robotics</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/marine\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>marine</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/science\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>science</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/design\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>design</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/innovation\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>innovation</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/autonomy\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>autonomy</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/nature\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>nature</span></a></p>",
