    "note": "<p>Follow The Kid Should See This for daily posts and science news. Founded in 2011, TKSST features over 8,000 kid-friendly videos for educators and parents sharing smarter, meaningful media at home and in the classroom. Made with 💙 in L.A.</p><p>Curated by <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://journa.host/@cosentino\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>cosentino</span></a></span> (ex-KPCC, IHT, NYT, CBS News).</p><p><a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/video\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>video</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/science\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>science</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/scicomm\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>scicomm</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/education\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>education</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/edutech\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>edutech</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/museums\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>museums</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/engineering\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>engineering</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/story\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>story</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/astronomy\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>astronomy</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/art\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>art</span></a> <a href=\"https://fediscience.org/tags/design\" class=\"