  {
   "id": "117367682090549472",
   "created_at": "2026-10-01T21:05:01.000Z",
   "in_reply_to_id": null,
   "in_reply_to_account_id": null,
   "sensitive": false,
   "spoiler_text": "",
   "visibility": "public",
   "language": "en",
   "uri": "https://mstdn.business/users/cnbusinessforum/statuses/117367681931284713",
   "url": "https://mstdn.business/@cnbusinessforum/117367681931284713",
   "replies_count": 0,
   "reblogs_count": 2,
   "favourites_count": 0,
   "quotes_count": 0,
   "edited_at": null,
   "content": "<p>The <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/Yuelu\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>Yuelu</span></a> <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/Conference\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>Conference</span></a> 2026 brought artificial intelligence companies, <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/robotics\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>robotics</span></a> <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/developers\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>developers</span></a>, researchers and <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/investors\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>investors</span></a> to <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/Changsha\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>Changsha</span></a>, <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/Hunan\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>Hunan</span></a> Province, <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/China\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>China</span></a>, on September 23–24, 2026. Changsha <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/AI\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>AI</span></a> conference featured an opening ceremony, ten “AI+” <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/forums\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>forums</span></a> and an <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/innovation\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>innovation</span></a> <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/exhibition\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>exhibition</span></a> covering <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/technologies\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>technologies</span></a> ranging from <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/semiconductors\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>semiconductors</span></a> and <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/computing\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>computing</span></a> <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/infrastructure\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>infrastructure</span></a> to <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/humanoid\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>humanoid</span></a> <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/robots\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>robots</span></a> and <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/digital\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>digital</span></a> <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/healthcare\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>healthcare</span></a>. <a href=\"https://chinaexpohub.com/yuelu-conference-2026-unveils-rmb-10-billion-future-industries-fund-plan/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">chinaexpohub.com/yuelu-confere</span><span class=\"invisible\">nce-2026-unveils-rmb-10-billion-future-industries-fund-plan/</span></a></p>",
