  {
   "id": "117367417142309423",
   "created_at": "2026-10-01T19:57:38.000Z",
   "in_reply_to_id": null,
   "in_reply_to_account_id": null,
   "sensitive": false,
   "spoiler_text": "",
   "visibility": "public",
   "language": "en",
   "uri": "https://mstdn.business/users/cnbusinessforum/statuses/117367416992075838",
   "url": "https://mstdn.business/@cnbusinessforum/117367416992075838",
   "replies_count": 0,
   "reblogs_count": 2,
   "favourites_count": 0,
   "quotes_count": 0,
   "edited_at": null,
   "content": "<p>Four major <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/HongKong\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>HongKong</span></a> <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/technology\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>technology</span></a> <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/fairs\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>fairs</span></a> will bring <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/electronics\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>electronics</span></a>, artificial intelligence (#AI), <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/robotics\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>robotics</span></a>, <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/electronic\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>electronic</span></a> components and <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/lighting\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>lighting</span></a> solutions together during October 2026. The <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/HK\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>HK</span></a> <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/Trade\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>Trade</span></a> Development Council expects the <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/exhibitions\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>exhibitions</span></a> to attract approximately 6,200 <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/exhibitors\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>exhibitors</span></a> from 28 countries and regions. Because the <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/expos\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>expos</span></a> take place on different dates and at two <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/venues\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>venues</span></a>, <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/international\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>international</span></a> <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/business\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>business</span></a> <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/buyers\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>buyers</span></a> will need to <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/plan\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>plan</span></a> their <a href=\"https://mstdn.business/tags/schedules\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>schedules</span></a> carefully. <a href=\"https://chinaexpohub.com/ai-robotics-and-smart-lighting-take-centre-stage-at-hong-kong-tech-fairs-2026/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">chinaexpohub.com/ai-robotics-a</span><span class=\"invisible\">nd-smart-lighting-take-centre-stage-at-hong-kong-tech-fairs-2026/</span></a></p>",
